<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/65ea6cb737ce> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "Masayuki Nakamoto, who runs his own website in the southern prefecture of Hyogo, lifted images of porn stars from Japanese adult videos and doctored them with the same method used to create realistic face swaps in deepfake videos." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "1742" .

